$\mathrm{L}=\mathrm{v}_{\mathrm{o}}+\mathrm{f}_{\mathrm{e}}=35.3+3=38.3 \mathrm{ cm}$

21469.sol:
We have, $f(x)$ is an even function. \begin{array}{ll}
\therefore & f(-x)=f(x) \\
\Rightarrow & f^{\prime}(-x)(-1)=f^{\prime}(x) \\
\Rightarrow & f^{\prime}(x)+f^{\prime}(-x)=0 \\
\Rightarrow & f^{\prime}(e)+f^{\prime}(-e)=0
\end{array}

